  "news_title_8": "Client list and Kassa updated 🚀",
  "news_content_8": "We are glad to bring you new features and improvements",
  "news_bullets_8": "- Sort clients into folders and find them fast alphabetically\n- Search results are ranked more accurately\n- Each folder remembers its own filter and order\n- Income/expense filter and period summary on the client page\n- Table view — with a running balance on every row\n- A balance dynamics chart in Kassa\n- Resend an SMS straight from history",
  "news_title_9": "Voice mailings and seller permissions 🚀",
  "news_content_9": "We are glad to bring you new features and improvements",
  "news_bullets_9": "- Voice messages to clients — like SMS, but spoken\n- Granular seller permissions: you decide who can do what\n- Write straight to a client's debt from the sales calculator\n- Pin a client's location on the map and navigate there\n- The Tasks section and the Ambassador programme",
  "news_title_10": "Karakalpak language, Google sign-in and Products 🚀",
  "news_content_10": "We are glad to bring you new features and improvements",
  "news_bullets_10": "- Karakalpak added — four languages now\n- Sign up and sign in with Google\n- The Products section: list, product page, photo and history\n- Improve a product photo with AI\n- Print receipts on a thermal printer\n- Try any Premium tariff free for 10 days\n- A client balance in two currencies",
  "news_title_11": "pDaftar now has a full Warehouse 🚀",
  "news_content_11": "We are glad to bring you new features and improvements",
  "news_bullets_11": "- Sklad is now Ombor: deliveries, stock and movement history\n- Start a delivery from the warehouse list or from a product page\n- A QR is printed on the invoice — the buyer scans it into their own stock\n- Product barcodes and label printing on a thermal printer\n- Read an invoice from a photo with AI\n- Mixed payment on a sale: part cash, part credit\n- Printer settings: model detection, paper width, test receipt\n- Monthly salary tracking for employees\n- Invite a supplier by SMS\n- Print the shop QR as a keyring tag",
  "news_title_12": "Product statistics added 🚀",
  "news_content_12": "We are glad to bring you new features and improvements",
  "news_bullets_12": "- A Products tab in statistics: money sitting in stock, items sold at a loss, dead stock\n- You decide whether a seller may change the price\n- Scan a barcode straight into the cart on the Sotuv tab\n- The shop QR is now a link — an ordinary phone camera opens it",
